 "prompt": "Use the measured design system of pen.dev – An agentic canvas for building bold software (pen.dev), from the Artspo book \"The Artbook library\" (https://artbook.dev/library/), as a reference. These are measurements of the live site, not its code: rebuild the feel with your own content.\n\n## Palette\n- Surfaces, by share of the page: #DBE0E6 41%, #EAEDF0 31%, #0D0D0D 6.7%, #00000026 3.5%, imagery 18%\n- Text, by amount of text: #0D0D0D8C 50%, #00000070 22%, #0D0D0D 21%, #FFFFFF 4%\n\n## Type\n- Display: InterDisplay 32px/400, letter-spacing -0.02em, line-height 1.13\n- Body: InterDisplay 16px, line-height 24px\n- Scale (px/weight): 44/400, 32/400, 20/400, 16/500\n- Families by text share: InterDisplay 100%\n\n## Shape\n- Radii: 4px (34×); 8px (27×); 12px (9×); 9999px (3×)\n- Shadows: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12) 0px 0.5px 2px 0px (1×); rgba(44, 48, 62, 0.09) 0px 0px 125px 0px, rgba(44, 48, 62, 0.05) 0px 0px 55.841px 0px, rgba(44, 48, 62, 0.04) 0px 0px 16.625px 0px (1×)\n- Borders: 1px solid #00000014 (9×); 1px solid #0D0D0D (3×); 1px solid #C6C7CB (1×)\n- Spacing: 4px grid; section padding 80px, 40px, 240px, 160px; gaps 20px, 8px, 72px, 64px\n\n## Buttons\n- filled #0D0D0D, text #FFFFFF, radius 9999px, padding 0px 16px, 14px/500\n- filled #0D0D0D, text #FFFFFF, radius 24px, padding 12px 20px, 16px/400\n\n## Motion\n- Libraries: WebGL canvas\n- On load, 1× div.mark.hero-seq: animation hero-in; 500ms, cubic-bezier(0.19, 1, 0.22, 1)\n- On load, 1× div.goodies-head: transition on opacity, transform; 550ms, cubic-bezier(0.19, 1, 0.22, 1), approximate\n- On load, 4× div.feat-col, div.feat-col: transition on opacity, transform; 550ms, cubic-bezier(0.19, 1, 0.22, 1), approximate\n- On load, 8× div.model-card, div.model-card: transition on opacity, transform; 550ms, cubic-bezier(0.19, 1, 0.22, 1), 40ms stagger, approximate\n- On load, 2× div.intro, div.intro: transition on opacity, transform; 550ms, cubic-bezier(0.19, 1, 0.22, 1), approximate\n- On load, 1× div.models-head: transition on opacity, transform; 550ms, cubic-bezier(0.19, 1, 0.22, 1), approximate\n- On load, 1× div.nib-wrap: transition on opacity, transform; 550ms, cubic-bezier(0.19, 1, 0.22, 1), approximate\n- On load, 1× div.foot-col: transition on opacity; 550ms, cubic-bezier(0.19, 1, 0.22, 1), approximate\n- On scroll, 1× div.hero-inner: transition on opacity; 250ms, ease, at scrollY≈720, approximate\n- On scroll, 2× div.intro.revealed, div.intro.revealed: transition on opacity, transform; 550ms, cubic-bezier(0.19, 1, 0.22, 1), between scrollY 720–4320, approximate\n- On scroll, 1× div.video-card.revealed: transition on opacity, transform; 550ms, cubic-bezier(0.19, 1, 0.22, 1), 80ms delay, at scrollY≈720, approximate\n- On scroll, 1× div.rebrand-banner: transition on opacity, transform; 450ms, cubic-bezier(0.19, 1, 0.22, 1), 120ms delay, at scrollY≈720, approximate\n- On scroll, 1× nav.site-nav: transition on opacity, transform; 450ms, cubic-bezier(0.19, 1, 0.22, 1), 120ms delay, at scrollY≈720, approximate\n- On scroll, 1× div.goodies-head.revealed: transition on opacity, transform; 550ms, cubic-bezier(0.19, 1, 0.22, 1), 20ms stagger, at scrollY≈2160, approximate\n- On scroll, 1× div.models-head.revealed: transition on opacity, transform; 550ms, cubic-bezier(0.19, 1, 0.22, 1), 20ms stagger, at scrollY≈2880, approximate\n- On scroll, 8× div.model-card.revealed, div.model-card.revealed: transition on opacity, transform; 550ms, cubic-bezier(0.19, 1, 0.22, 1), 40ms stagger, at scrollY≈2880, approximate\n- Looping, 1× div.cta-nib: animation nib-float; 6000ms, linear, infinite\n- Declared transition on color, background, transform, box-shadow: 150ms ease (31 elements)\n- Declared transition on opacity, transform: 550ms cubic-bezier(0.19, 1, 0.22, 1) (42 elements)\n- Declared transition on opacity: 400ms ease (4 elements)\n- Declared transition on opacity, transform: 450ms cubic-bezier(0.19, 1, 0.22, 1) (4 elements)\n- Declared transition on opacity: 200ms ease (2 elements